# All knobs at both ends (fm2 ignores filter and resonance), very low and very high notes, glide via pitch bend.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.3
track lead
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C0 4 127
note 4 C8 4 127
param p1 0 8
param p2 0 8
note 8 C2 4 1
param p1 176 12
param p2 255 12
note 12 G6 4 127
bend 12 200
expect peak_below 0
